{"id":"en_i-hired-my-husband-s-mistress","title":"I Hired My Husband's Mistress","titleEn":"I Hired My Husband's Mistress","description":"On her fifth wedding anniversary, Ellara Vance discovers her husband Kallan in bed with Anya, an influencer and model. She then overhears him planning to poison her with a neurotoxin so she appears insane, allowing him to have her committed to a Swiss clinic and take control of the Vance family fortune. Rather than confront him, Ellara feigns compliance and launches a covert counterattack. She turns to Lysander Vale, a childhood friend now working as a powerful Wall Street attorney, for help. She also hires Anya through a private staffing agency to live in her home, placing her husband's mistress under her own roof. At a high-society tea party, Ellara presents a composed public image that undermines Kallan's narrative of a mad wife. Through deliberate provocations, she leads Anya to unders","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-hired-my-husbands-mistress/en_US/c69ae2d39bc7c269/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-hired-my-husbands-mistress/en_US/c69ae2d39bc7c269/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnrag/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_i-hired-my-husband-s-mistress_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnrag/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-hired-my-husband-s-mistress_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnrag/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-hired-my-husband-s-mistress_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)",